Subject: [PATCH 34/39] fix: standby has no codename/slot; promote inherits
 them from suspended number

---
 src/pages/WANumbers.jsx | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 39 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/pages/WANumbers.jsx b/src/pages/WANumbers.jsx
index 00b077a..b4b485c 100644
